description	"Guavian Death Enforcer

Resilent cyborg gangsters with low velocity weaponry.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Swing Speed
- Pulsar-38 Carbine (1)
-- Pistol
-- 20%+ Velocity
-- 40%- Damage
-- 20%- FP Mult
-- 45%+ RoF
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Assemble (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- Stamina (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS4]"
